/*
 * Implements validation for the `__pragma!parameter_infos(F)` construct.
 *
 * The pragma describes the parameters of a function, a
 * core::types::info::ParamInfo per parameter, as `__pragma!field_infos`
 * describes the fields of a type.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::pragma::parameter_infos
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/pragma/parameter_infos.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-10-31
